    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "А что я за мэр такой, который держит своё слово?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That's it for this one. If the vocabulary felt heavy, don't worry: just listen out for the cry about giving your word, and Arkady's cheeky answer. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
